{"name":"柯莱","name_en":"Collei","sources":["hoyolab"],"items":[{"title":"初次见面","title_en":"","text":"见习巡林员柯莱，前来报到！我会保障你在林间出行时的安全——呼，总算能说出这句出场词了，我没念错字吧…","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/7fea5823fbdda242e5cca34183635fae_8031945060238537564.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/230a022d02aaf8489c68ff9bd3676ab5_5979258246733829986.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/5b0681b7d9b8fca028b87cfe652f4cc1_8071888176317190755.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/b0451abdbf4bfbaa60b6a258de1290a3_2021947049199264388.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"闲聊·巡林路线图","title_en":"","text":"今天的巡林路线图…先往这里再拐到那里…嗯，字好多…","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/5d33365964b1913f5d4a0a8abed57d05_4049960648756029498.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/a0ff130b389ec285b432ec6f737b7a08_7294020244647382107.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/9ec9e31abe58f15d327a029d5cff1dde_993968336616487720.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e5f604202ae0c6ebb2112eeca137c646_805441966847737832.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"闲聊·状态","title_en":"","text":"呼，今天的状态不错，趁着这个机会，多做一点事吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/9539e9c0be88a125bad1b1503d806883_4821455811398814442.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/0d093af3d6e6f423d3c6058fb9b984e7_8629967066034948631.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/3eba21a783e19189a2a86ccae907fd90_8672921507300857459.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/efad3b46a938070d9ed000a70c26fa05_5483451734680124873.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"闲聊·回忆","title_en":"","text":"手头没有事情，心里就容易东想西想——唔，一说就想起了不好的事…","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/1772e474f2f3747fcca90a580265554b_4660674532252302665.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/ad20f40258e324217fad89bea62cd557_1783948967338991677.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/9673959b88890356ba296e772ca16a4e_6139283241424973064.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/0c8f86ac500ce006a147d1fb3adb06a8_4334126584180060897.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"雨过天晴","title_en":"","text":"雨虽然停了，还是要小心水洼。就像一些事，明明过去了还是会留下回忆…咳咳！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/d9d623f2d6e6ab6273bb4df6b2cfedce_3817264045592602318.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/b505986b254b741a254179d76dfe1df5_3548719161600655415.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/ddb1afc332e5d5b9c5ccc88c9543d6f8_1632754465154788507.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/950c0b25ba89fdfe5906ddf51b16083c_3886920894293817896.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"打雷的时候","title_en":"","text":"打雷的时候，最好避开大树。对巡林员来说，还要格外注意检查，谨防森林火灾。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/95b1133ba81a6166235d8cf940e06d47_5276521853038237910.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/19878506ef56c533381b9d976bd3c89a_5536056679450108897.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/28c7c3b519ea66a48ccec6775b7dd99d_7197899559031889090.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/f18a53cecbac4d300b1c36df855295f4_1738940278698281269.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"阳光很好","title_en":"","text":"天气不错，多晒晒太阳，对身体也好。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/6931eab95eb402c19eff4588e889ac06_2178538174913073143.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/8975a4f718d27330650601dbe9af3372_3482075648611608039.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e93f0377764709e58365481510dab199_4296000375019822643.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/09f83e767ec3a86f0b2f682498eb0afa_2197535621500373270.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"刮大风了","title_en":"","text":"嗯，风力正好。安柏应该会很喜欢趁这样的天气挑战自己吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/466ab56ee1a188f04418ba87984b62e8_4403886960220013649.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/71184626dd4bc7d90b5f7b0b1ce6ec18_4868943015580760962.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/91e1d01dd493ec42f160ad562912653c_8266900620926430466.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/d6617f6a27ca764ec23388139bce2865_2840835072347006507.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"早上好","title_en":"","text":"早上好！哈…抱歉，昨晚又在补习…","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/8b93b7bdea133fecd1e5cd9774ddf73e_5619800395874394286.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/14e540b794277b104537da07d2d986f3_1153661213377986878.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/b3ec5b28dbb9b137d35ce369a1336e7b_1808428719699877187.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/dc51c6028581070d48c5ee1e1e0536be_2731198810299471966.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"中午好","title_en":"","text":"巡林路线一长，中午回不来也很正常。我多准备了一些「口袋饼」，要来一份吗？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/97d9ae8fdb04eb0e7d3b02445f134ce5_8452575231294918429.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/1d770c8d62bb5c7d14cb557652160da9_1570414689882680625.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/4ed7fa7af4f1e50ae73550368e200cd5_6436833382666511315.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/f0860124ccf1ce1ce21cede8bb81b590_6520047599119535529.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"晚上好","title_en":"","text":"天快黑了，走在林子里一定要加倍小心。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/4e3cd85a37b551bc4a63ad6b4e2c5af8_6762070209293134464.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/b03689d3f44bd81845aca46b51e0df8f_5521989218838209701.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/195413acd82cb1d143d28287decc2287_6412712077504211574.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/0352c5158a972d15272c0e455ae1c598_3726359132945299241.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"晚安","title_en":"","text":"准备休息了吗？篝火已经生好了，我会为你守夜的。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/a569eabbde83ef471c9ab2063f635d5f_163506642257552229.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/7b419e9852fc6b2b948edd849fff7b0b_1891146553036389026.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/fdb46ab021cfaa3ff824bc6849874919_1349360596394646.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/4ead38924ac363a9b3f755fde8cec8ed_1958736240688113382.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于柯莱自己·巡林","title_en":"","text":"来须弥之前，我在野外流浪过一段日子，能吃不能吃的东西都尝过了好几遍，对野外还算熟悉，所以来这儿之后就做起了巡林的工作。如果「野外生存」也算一门课目的话，我还是有自信考到及格的…嗯，不做笔试的话。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/40b6342b790f1f32b42e836410b139d0_7387964551810615237.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/373f1869f7f3221a7a2a884540ce344b_7732529587377450411.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/466abafe551a31b8c76851caa3f97c7c_521736632758494166.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/db97b61abea1853afb4cc3c8c9d77a3b_5231350991372557820.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于柯莱自己·补习","title_en":"","text":"欸？你问我每天都在补习什么？跟着这么厉害的师父，是不是什么很高深的知识…呃…这个么…《提瓦特识字大全》…","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/1ed5e8b21e7ad9809207ad3c93d18967_4457562025292581394.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/34c4c37992e4d6fd22eb0906c4cf117d_6265996472053532386.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/d4a0076b15e7b6ef9cae471f040d2bdf_7530397076597102582.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/0bfd109631258d3dbf1b4624730b349f_6379877768302588811.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于我们·旧识","title_en":"","text":"我听安柏在信里提起过你，没想到在蒙德又发生了这么多事。可惜跳着字读，好多细节都没弄懂…欸，你愿意再跟我讲一遍吗？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/f0541142f28ec3bf799a874073023527_1834186752363644621.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/4a21a7d56da70855e97da1a6c63edf28_595220774608802746.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/98c7d8266ceb1a4674f59ab9301e7c34_5238775528093804007.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/f880c0c00119e7edb8efb68cc5613ec0_1249122363099710133.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于我们·新交","title_en":"","text":"我曾经以为「朋友」什么的，这辈子都不会和我扯上关系，直到去了蒙德…后来在须弥遇见了师父，现在又遇到了你。果然，我还是很幸运的啊。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/2c2f5db3a3e732f0a26ec5c72842452e_2749038090037946689.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/6b972297a962fd972ee484c39907f929_7572349374737792582.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/80e781027f552a592aa322f9e785220e_6567632587092539597.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/ce8e4b020faaf000daf72c622afdcfab_2440849656039587309.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于「神之眼」","title_en":"","text":"哈…真没想到，我也会有拿到神之眼的一天。以前总觉得神明会看的，都是那些生来就被大家喜欢的人…唔，我…我承认我有很多不好的偏见。是我不对。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e12368fb89344434656d7ca7bfbc95a1_7310887470919496796.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/f9c3c6974f976c11d727387b0ca5d4fc_3803978088070183292.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/1a1ce806c69ccd3f896abdeecd7069bd_4433592841382741247.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e046b928a125307b94cfc7005fc4cef8_4678201051074258497.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"有什么想要分享·技能名","title_en":"","text":"师父常说最有效的学习就是实践，所以我偶尔也会找些轻小说来看，想多认些字…起码比师父的论文好读。不过，我最近读到的一本书里，主角有好多能力，起的名字全是我看不懂的词…嗯？书的名字？应该是叫…《鬼武道》？你也读过吗？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/d6b584a44a4321ddb92706a1cf5804f9_517191818032815710.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/db4105105f5ca0f3dad776a6d7abdd07_4653151732541051364.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/b0d1f7c6c3431da2e6ab989906001499_5441860560252106191.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/027ad179df0e2a1af26d36e424c4ae44_8352600196537492465.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"有什么想要分享·封印之力","title_en":"","text":"唔哇…又是「被封印的力量在躁动」…还有什么「离我远点才是上策」…为什么稻妻人都能这么自然地说出这些话，他们以后不会觉得尴尬吗？啊…不行，不能再读下去了！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/cd4b6497cb35806c22f705872c9ab764_5046531801809791884.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/4fb89cf6d9f1dbcb9406445a80debbfd_1605556839435125022.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/94061dfb274c6d1f57ff05831127cac8_4838606920087510376.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/49eb19afcea733f5574caee3526a796c_4206994529721896902.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻","title_en":"","text":"花草动物吗…除了能不能吃，好像也没有太大区别。嘘，这话不能被师父听见。要问我的话，我比较喜欢有树洞的树？尤其是在想要「找个地方钻进去」的时候…每个人都会有的吧？不是吗？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/f12a7a0bc7c137a91f8450597283753e_7800193437620144324.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/8c13b1fd9e2687fa31bf1a21b33596ab_2258662310564606237.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/6bf9a87c34ac047abb88c23a7f4ede45_8027124002623406518.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/bfec618b4cae22cb42abd8224bc98231_7024550728932401362.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于提纳里","title_en":"","text":"师父虽然平时说话有些严厉，还经常批评那些乱吃毒蘑菇的冒险家，但他其实是个很温柔的人。不仅会耐心地给我补课，还会为我读蒙德寄来的信。我一直很感激他！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/4e393031c46271013cfb730ab04931a3_4551338609732953131.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/b35a0dd9965195ab17ef67d2583fc4bc_7267144163729584494.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/7021566c048d19a0fb774e641852e3b6_108975165073625580.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/c8cdc843ec38103158f91ed9d49c04e1_7499871016418369979.mp3"}},"line":0},{"title":"关于多莉","title_en":"","text":"有次我在巡林路上遇见了她，像是知道我口渴一样，她从袋子里掏出了一瓶看起来特别好喝的果汁…还好当时师父在场，制止了她。不然，我差点就一个冲动，把好不容易攒起来的摩拉都花出去了…","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/ae2e1a4053709bbf643222d6a5e0e09d_7443652476374858909.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/4b96b1fe38d9bb215b7d39c9f929f2f5_5702564762774171362.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e7437136214205b4ef0d39ec2c02baed_5113742675022462430.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/9edd85c7245a535f23dcafcf5cca4fc9_4198968555539451202.mp3"}},"line":1},{"title":"关于小吉祥草王","title_en":"","text":"草神啊…小时候我很多次想大声问问神明，为什么要让我经历这么多苦难。唉，说不定就连神明自己，也经历着各种无奈的事吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/913386233aa1cca0c0ff8000fb9da03b_7678716028283876919.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/66e5657e370f955881542f9169a967cd_5987081939626724383.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/eeb580f64cbf99451210f3d20d42fc24_9091922223097154480.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/a3964b2290d5e3c05e7fddc3e3f41d6a_2832249581279043548.mp3"}},"line":2},{"title":"关于赛诺","title_en":"","text":"欸…我们能不提他吗？不，大风纪官不是什么坏人，当初就是他带着我从蒙德回到了须弥，才让我有了安身的地方。只是一想起回须弥前那个「封印」的过程…唔…脖子后边又开始觉得痛了…","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e9af7c9b341a3399e775add58df9077e_210203582647041172.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/75827a93ff9572ac4521aabf79d98717_593503565985025217.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/85f1030d3412e797fad9b4c066601f58_3208107576451613215.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/fe5f44d033a6c28d0a46a68c496aa006_8677083252876589315.mp3"}},"line":3},{"title":"关于卡维","title_en":"","text":"大风纪官曾带着他来我们这里吃过一顿饭。在餐前水果刚端上桌的时候，他就开始大谈他那个又不讲情理又固执的室友，我们连插话的时机都找不到。只能点点头，憋着笑，吃完了整顿饭。唉，真是不容易。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/a56a6743dda6a69119752fef14b1ea4a_6987183212208235338.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/a56e4d1febf9707a2f967647b91094c6_3729878753880005479.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/91cb15ddb4bd2885533f7b97154f2641_8481447965770891214.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/2257fc35b5e01df167e776a9269b69e0_1636610184935233274.mp3"}},"line":4},{"title":"关于妮露","title_en":"","text":"感觉她有点迷迷糊糊的样子，如果来化城郭附近表演的话，不会走着走着就迷路在深林里吧…那我可一定要好好看着她，尽我见习巡林员的职责。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/3c1281cfc532b9cfa2ce92aa8b8d8421_1231524438741338668.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e944963392eb1de0e6956e74db6d8ce2_1012569365728595524.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/aa546b6c56cd7c7d486003edeb7b5aa2_7063153109818432171.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/240bae6e010afcd5dd8298f643c44355_1577822277662252753.mp3"}},"line":5},{"title":"关于安柏","title_en":"","text":"安柏她真的很厉害，又热情又活泼，又勇敢又正义…是我最钦佩、最崇拜的人了！她总能像一团火一样照亮别人，要不是她，我肯定没法走到今天这一步…过了这么久，她现在一定变得更加沉稳、更加帅气了吧！真不知道什么时候才能赶上她。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/54a69ff6a6a686d7fe7ea77c180f6ba6_1370987879882881757.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/6733dcda392cc8ecb7a545c878fd0d01_2061823517563484468.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/d5af46a67c1be6b68dcf7667ad76731b_7408110619081535461.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e967bc8a9a4790675ee43b7c65042258_169082140713654496.mp3"}},"line":6},{"title":"关于凯亚","title_en":"","text":"蒙德的大家都还好吗？那阵子我可是惹了不少麻烦啊，要不要找个时间回去道歉呢…唔，但感觉一露面就会被那位骑兵队长捉弄…还是再等等吧，再等等…","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/1f4395e2eeaf9e913b42ce288c507d74_9117983052612710574.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/f384e22505e07a084174a066c5cc7769_3899428750084604544.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/d942c4d61fee20eb79cbc16a3f5c3bb6_5122018765833186990.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/b5793e718557fd0fed21e691669152de_8713297395246229741.mp3"}},"line":7},{"title":"关于丽莎","title_en":"","text":"明明已经过去了那么久，丽莎给我写信的时候，还是在叫我「小柯莱」，总感觉…嗯？你说她也叫你小可爱？噗…对不起，我不是有意要笑出来的…一下子就开心了好多啊。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/d09af03518465f02b65304f929c74184_7551922072892853590.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/b573f476da9e878754dc03fa7ac21124_7156443778951214688.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/87c6f0769c86e16c202fa6470896048a_5448036192783690914.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/079626a14cbf83e576b5f47d298a0a85_8353460866497258176.mp3"}},"line":8},{"title":"关于菲谢尔","title_en":"","text":"…「断罪之皇女」？抱歉，我在蒙德待的时间不长，没有听过这样的人物。不过这个名字…嘶…咳，没什么。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/5fc0fe67069af8c1030da71ac2a964d0_2560544196075729138.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e1e852348d99dc0221bafffc7543a5e8_7181861729220719928.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/89a48f58737dcd0d6b984b1584fe983e_812827703343788053.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/091c484429b5004e1a5c9c48c9667a5a_47849039923746014.mp3"}},"line":9},{"title":"关于珐露珊","title_en":"","text":"呃…老实说，我不太擅长应付这位前辈…虽然她经常夸我勤奋好学，但我真的是因为学得太慢，没办法了，才总是在补习啊！还有一回，我不小心看到了她的研究笔记，虽然只瞟了一眼，但那绝对是全须弥最可怕的书！——上面全是古文，我连半个字都看不懂。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/4895e3b2cd4182d1f263e39951858592_9108774894564845684.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e4b50dd9fe429bf4e59e0060e918784a_3134896119220405033.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/101053cb687e4adad9f6e06989d7408b_6735273915022919126.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e6f341b33d061623514865372f35d668_6291751200486305588.mp3"}},"line":10},{"title":"想要了解柯莱·其一","title_en":"","text":"我的事情么？如果你问的是来须弥之前的…唔，要不…你写信问一下安柏？啊，不行，要是让凯亚发现了就全完了…不对，他肯定会发现的吧！还、还是我自己来说吧，呼——对不起！请先让我再做几天心理准备…","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/c36116dae128c38a1f194974261dcec2_3475597821933981056.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/fd4f1822fea19be8ba4bf2086325c097_3177361551619668633.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/8647b94d22daa6755c61216d2823cb76_1525221890888476011.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e9b266b23e94909145a55f0cf5897d27_3707552261766948381.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解柯莱·其二","title_en":"","text":"流浪到蒙德的时候，我对安柏他们说了很多不该说的话，现在回想起来还是会很羞愧…我这人真是的，怎么能对想帮我的人说那些话呢！他们那时候究竟是怎么看我的？想想就又…呜，抱歉，今天先到这里可以吗？不然等到明天…我又要为刚刚说过的话后悔了。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/a778c05589bec700b9144169a3ed844b_1829513739103100645.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/f7efcd4843ed5600479aa4917b4c95a5_4409889646298385393.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/27b4ed97485790c36ee2aa10e7b12db9_4836827938534509325.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/444c41f9ec710d5101339aa99bee7771_2685243996151484000.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解柯莱·其三","title_en":"","text":"因为「魔鳞病」的关系，我曾经被送到「博士」手下治疗…不，那不是治疗，而是「实验」。在那种环境里待久了，我也不由开始想，自己到底做错了什么？为什么没有人来救我…渐渐地，就连「愚人众」以外的人也一并恨上了。现在想想…实在是，太幼稚了。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e2e2c39c001b6f3f1c2e6f19cf0c125a_2711543516342407689.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/5ec7012b1c5e798d9b2a35f70984d742_197498404242866693.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/cf498ce1a211fec2645317dd3049a659_7906365130436267074.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/4533aeceebef9e420cd1d33e7eccf557_1885078913599624123.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解柯莱·其四","title_en":"","text":"多亏有你们在，「魔鳞病」消失了，是我从前想都不敢想的奇迹。嗯…我一直对完全治愈不抱希望，只想在身体不能活动前，多做一些事情。起初是复仇，后来是巡林…现在，我终于可以自由地活下去了。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/ea32c7e1d7f0bb4b1ff3e31bcaa42431_3178591244695462603.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/28df4c1a0abacb88b10713d75454997d_1857132296426477362.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/229f4d89deaca2b166ec63c5338b9f40_6132137749090403834.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/3befff5b6e9fb2e9297d6e1f61d48193_7769341117016011343.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解柯莱·其五","title_en":"","text":"你接下来还会继续旅行吗，请让我多尽一份力吧。我会努力学习…不管是认字还是学医术，还有战斗、排查危险…甚至是检查路灯这种小事！希望这一路上，能有更多和我一样的人得到帮助——就像你拯救了我一样。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/cdb35e6a75908beb0273d26a077bbfd4_7096146754084436095.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e072848082ba38ce71b87349d2786ab0_3571477701665768.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/29f270577d25ab3cdbfdf615c7798b39_3911176143032688421.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/f046bca46b121581d315482502af6b7c_6541321065978159807.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"柯莱的爱好","title_en":"","text":"爱好嘛…缝纫、练习飞行，还有帮助他人！嗯？你说听着有点耳熟？因为…我也想成为「能照亮别人的人」。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/f4cdacd4d87bdd84c3dfa662da9c5d69_101352706101993162.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/744c2f7f2ab5920963f91cff3badcf8d_4799306230480349664.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/26a8cad7f878d36ba8fe11220c1fe7b9_8097909202696719540.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/dcdd79d5886be6f2482b12a9cbf2953d_1845704772334593571.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"柯莱的烦恼","title_en":"","text":"「针对当前…农作物品种…单一化…避兔长期食用菌类…采取的进口错施…」——这都是什么和什么啊？为什么教令院的论文连「不想吃蘑菇」都能写得这么复杂啊！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/8ef6299f08c12d9a79f9ac7b156bd8b6_3794005390152854217.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/f1a719b1c63eaab0866f7e2e68ac3b75_9131293674758625965.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/c9b12212cdcba9ba5c0b823d59c47930_2248847312364866572.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/f74629980d88633c8608992f007d1a0c_1920680927058503987.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"喜欢的食物","title_en":"","text":"「口袋饼」方便携带，又容易吃饱，应该是我最常吃的东西了？如果不考虑肚子的需要，我最喜欢的食物…嗯，应该是「炸萝卜丸子」吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/f6b17753d963430a59d03eafbfec8557_4075528625971510853.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/2bf2d01b8506a82ea606eaabb1846c47_23334267412651200.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/f68e75459cc46c036aeb05a8b4c808a2_7789318646114332338.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/fb690a0a120c40717de2ad0f379644f1_8490542858639257665.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"讨厌的食物","title_en":"","text":"流浪的时候肚子饿了，连钩钩果都要掰碎了吃下去，所以我没有什么特别讨厌的食物。一定要说的话，我不会碰的只有各种蘑菇吧？和口味无关，只是不希望被师父长篇大论批评的人是自己而已…","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/4fe8d0eeb8bcbf4d2dd1